  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SLV Prosecutors Office II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SLV &#xc5;klagarmyndigheten II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till utveckling av informationssystem inom  riks&#xe5;klagarmyndigheten i El Salvador. Fas 2 (2008 - dec 2009). Insatsen syftar till att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra kommunikationen med allm&#xe4;nheten., medborgarna skall genom tillg&#xe5;ng till information om de processer och fall som behandlas f&#xe5; ett st&#xf6;rre f&#xf6;rtroende f&#xf6;r r&#xe4;ttsv&#xe4;sendet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the development of information systems within the Prosecutors office in El Salvador. Phase 2 (2008-2009). The  contribution aims to improve communication with the public. Citizens will get greater access to information about processes and cases that are handeled and through this greater reliance on the judiciary system.</narrative>
  </description>
